# Walkway segment: a ROAD segment on a scaffold (a cable of the conveyor medium, isCableType): one 2 m grid cell,
# painted like the road, in the road's runs, walked by the carriers. Its deck is 2 m over the ground
# (StructureSystem::WalkwayDeckHeight): the spawned origin is 2.1 above ground, 0.1 over the deck top.
# THIS prefab is the structure: the sills on the ground (what a blueprint shows) and a collider for PROJECTILES only
# (Layer Cable), from the ground to the deck. What a body stands on is a second entity the game adds when the piece
# is built (StructureSystem::updateWalkway): walkwayDeck.pre, or walkwayStairs.pre next to a plain road piece.
Prefab gameWalkway
	Component Render
		ObjectContainer walkway
		Node WalkwayFoot
		Type StaticMesh
		Color 0.42 0.3 0.17
	Component Physics
		Body Static
		ContactEvents true
		Layer Cable
		CollidesWith Projectile
		Shape Box
		HalfExtents 1 1.05 1
		Offset 0 -1.05 0
	Component GameStructure
		MeleeRadius 1
	# It stands on WATER too (standsOnWater: its ground is then the water surface): a PIER under the middle, from the
	# sills down to 11 m under them (three render-only pieces, like the Bridge's; it is in the ground on land).
	Component Scene
		Entity
			Name Pier1
			Position 0 -3.9 0
			Component Render
				ObjectContainer baseshapes
				Node Pillar3
				Type StaticMesh
				Color 0.36 0.26 0.15
				Scale 0.6
		Entity
			Name Pier2
			Position 0 -7.5 0
			Component Render
				ObjectContainer baseshapes
				Node Pillar3
				Type StaticMesh
				Color 0.36 0.26 0.15
				Scale 0.6
		Entity
			Name Pier3
			Position 0 -11.1 0
			Component Render
				ObjectContainer baseshapes
				Node Pillar3
				Type StaticMesh
				Color 0.36 0.26 0.15
				Scale 0.6
